# textdomain:twofactor_authentication

### Setup formspec
Account Security Setup=Account Security Setup
Create your secret word:=Create your secret word:
Create=Create
Disconnect=Disconnect
I dont want secret word=I don't want a secret word
Welcome to the server!=Welcome to the server!
Please create a secret word to secure your account.=Please create a secret word to secure your account.
This word is different from your password and adds extra protection.=This word is different from your password and adds extra protection.
You will be asked for this secret word each time you connect.=You will be asked for this secret word each time you connect.

### Verify formspec
Identity Verification=Identity Verification
Enter your secret word to access the server.=Enter your secret word to access the server.
Attempts remaining: %d=Attempts remaining: %d
The secret words are all hashed, so no one can obtain them.=Secret words are all hashed, therefore no one can obtain them
If you forgot your secret word, contact an administrator.=If you forgot your secret word, contact an administrator.
Hint: %s=Hint: %s
Enter your secret word:=Enter your secret word:
Error: =Error: 
Verify=Verify

### Validation messages
Secret word cannot be empty=Secret word cannot be empty
Secret word cannot contain only spaces=Secret word cannot contain only spaces

### Success/Info messages
[Security] %s=[Security] %s
[Security] Secret word created successfully. Keep it safe!=[Security] Secret word created successfully. Keep it safe!
[Security] You chose not to use a secret word.=[Security] You chose not to use a secret word.
[Security] Identity verified successfully. Welcome back!=[Security] Identity verified successfully. Welcome back!

### Error messages
Authentication failed: Too many incorrect attempts=Authentication failed: Too many incorrect attempts
Incorrect! %d attempt(s) remaining.=Incorrect! %d attempt(s) remaining.
Disconnected by user choice=Disconnected by user choice

### Chat command
Reset your secret word=Reset your secret word
You must be verified to use this command=You must be verified to use this command
